{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2044","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Easy Demon Problem"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For an arbitrary grid, Robot defines its "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to be the sum of elements in the grid. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Robot gives you an array $$$a$$$ of length $$$n$$$ and an array $$$b$$$ of length $$$m$$$. You construct a $$$n$$$ by $$$m$$$ grid $$$M$$$ such that $$$M_{i,j}=a_i\\cdot b_j$$$ for all $$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$ and $$$1 \\leq j \\leq m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then, Robot gives you $$$q$$$ queries, each consisting of a single integer $$$x$$$. For each query, determine whether or not it is possible to perform the following operation "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" once so that $$$M$$$ has a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$x$$$:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose integers $$$r$$$ and $$$c$$$ such that $$$1 \\leq r \\leq n$$$ and $$$1 \\leq c \\leq m$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Set $$$M_{i,j}$$$ to be $$$0$$$ for all ordered pairs $$$(i,j)$$$ such that $$$i=r$$$, $$$j=c$$$, or both. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that queries are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not persistent"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", meaning that you do not actually set any elements to $$$0$$$ in the process — you are only required to output if it is possible to find $$$r$$$ and $$$c$$$ such that if the above operation is performed, the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the grid will be $$$x$$$. Also, note that you must perform the operation for each query, even if the beauty of the original grid is already $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n,m \\leq 2\\cdot 10^5, 1 \\leq q \\leq 5\\cdot 10^4$$$) — the length of $$$a$$$, the length of $$$b$$$, and the number of queries respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$0 \\leq |a_i| \\leq n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$m$$$ integers $$$b_1, b_2, \\ldots, b_m$$$ ($$$0 \\leq |b_i| \\leq m$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$q$$$ lines each contain a single integer $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\leq |x| \\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$), the beauty of the grid you wish to achieve by setting all elements in a row and a column to $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each testcase, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) if there is a way to perform the aforementioned operation such that the beauty is $$$x$$$, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in any case (for example, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as a positive response)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 3 6\n-2 3 -3\n-2 2 -1\n-1\n1\n-2\n2\n-3\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 5 6\n1 -2 3 0 0\n0 -2 5 0 -3\n4\n-3\n5\n2\n-1\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, the grid is"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 -2 5 0 -3"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 4 -10 0 6"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 -6 15 0 -9"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 0 0 0"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 0 0 0"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"By performing the operation with $$$r=4$$$ and $$$c=2$$$, we create the following grid:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 5 0 -3"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 -10 0 6"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 15 0 -9"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 0 0 0"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0 0 0 0 0"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"which has "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$4$$$. Thus, we output "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second query, selecting $$$r=3$$$ and $$$c=5$$$ creates a grid with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$-3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"te